    <question_explanation no="15" id="PRB-DEF4A48A36DB2416-Q15">
      <question_stem>QPSK 성상도에서 심벌 신호점 위치 좌표가</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>성상도에서</keyword>
        <keyword>심벌</keyword>
        <keyword>신호점</keyword>
        <keyword>위치</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>3</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>$\sqrt{2}$</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 통신이론 · QPSK 신호점 간 거리
정답은 ③이다. 인접한 (1/√2, 1/√2)와 (−1/√2, 1/√2)의 거리는 2/√2 = √2이다.</overall_commentary>
      <passage_evidence>$\{( \frac{1}{\sqrt{2}}$, $\frac{1}{\sqrt{2}} )$,</passage_evidence>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$\sqrt{\frac{1}{2}}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$1$</choice_text>
          <commentary>계산이 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>$\sqrt{2}$</choice_text>
          <commentary>√2이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>$2$</choice_text>
          <commentary>대각선 방향 신호점 간의 거리이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
